message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper as below."
# TODO: replace the working title; the author list is tentative (see TODO.md).
title: "continuum-swr-replay: Source code for 'Non-local hippocampal events outside sharp-wave ripples (working title)'"
abstract: >-
  Source code, analysis scripts, and figure pipeline for a paper that
  characterizes non-local hippocampal events detected by a switching
  state-space decoder, inside and outside sharp-wave ripples, in rats
  performing a spatial bandit task, and how the events relate to behavior
  and to activity in prefrontal cortex.
